    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 28, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "啊——那边的典狱长，<br>\n最近怎么样？", "AuthorId": "Warden", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0205Adv09_Warden001"]}},
    {"op": "PlayBgm", "line": 30, "indent": 0, "params": {"BgmPath": "Bgm_23_1", "Volume": 1.0, "Loop": 1, "FadeInDuration": 20.0}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 32, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "还算凑合吧。<br>\n真是的，他们使唤鸟太狠了，好想放个长假啊。", "AuthorId": "Warden", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0205Adv09_Warden002"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 34, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "我这边呢，说来惊人，<br>\n诅咒居然解除了，人几乎都走得差不多了……<br>\n所以一下就清闲多了。", "AuthorId": "Warden", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0205Adv09_Warden003"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 36, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "嗬，还有这种情况啊。", "AuthorId": "Warden", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0205Adv09_Warden004"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 38, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "感觉还是挺稀奇的吧。<br>\n毕竟大家基本上都在互相残杀嘛。", "AuthorId": "Warden", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0205Adv09_Warden005"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 40, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "最近听其他监狱岛那边说，<br>\n他们那好像从第一天开始就杀得昏天黑地的样子……<br>\n你们那边呢，是在找【下一批预备魔女】吗？", "AuthorId": "Warden", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0205Adv09_Warden006"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 42, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "可不是嘛……<br>\n毕竟魔女因子还在全世界<br>\n持续扩散呢。", "AuthorId": "Warden", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0205Adv09_Warden007"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 44, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "祝您事立功成。我们都不能松懈啊。", "AuthorId": "Warden", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0205Adv09_Warden008"]}},
    {"op": "PrintTextModified", "line": 46, "indent": 0, "params": {"Text": "是啊。都是为了驱逐魔女。<br>\n这就是我们的工作嘛。", "AuthorId": "Warden", "RevealSpeed": 1.0, "WaitForInput": 1, "Wait": 1}, "text_ids": {"Text": ["0205Adv09_Warden009"]}},
